{
  "status": "PASS",
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
  "rate": "+5%",
  "seconds": 37.489,
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.06,
      "end": 0.657249,
      "text": "Why is this"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.671125,
      "end": 1.6989159999999999,
      "text": "road spraying water"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.712791,
      "end": 2.532208,
      "text": "in a snowstorm?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.7922211999999993,
      "end": 3.7922211999999993,
      "text": "In snowy parts"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.806096199999999,
      "end": 5.097762199999999,
      "text": "of Japan sprinklers"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.153346199999999,
      "end": 5.917221199999999,
      "text": "are built right"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.9310962,
      "end": 6.639470199999999,
      "text": "into the street."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.8994833999999985,
      "end": 7.871691399999999,
      "text": "Nozzles down the"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.885608399999999,
      "end": 8.3855664,
      "text": "middle of the"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.3994834,
      "end": 9.2189414,
      "text": "road spray"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.2328164,
      "end": 9.8439404,
      "text": "out water."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.103953599999999,
      "end": 10.7706196,
      "text": "It's pumped from"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.784494599999999,
      "end": 11.812286599999998,
      "text": "deep underground where"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.826161599999999,
      "end": 12.6456196,
      "text": "it stays around"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.659494599999999,
      "end": 13.6872856,
      "text": "fifty degrees."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.947298799999999,
      "end": 14.7389648,
      "text": "That's warmer than"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.752839799999999,
      "end": 15.4750898,
      "text": "snow so the"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.4889648,
      "end": 16.3084238,
      "text": "snow melts as"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.3222988,
      "end": 16.7667148,
      "text": "soon as"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.7806318,
      "end": 17.4195068,
      "text": "it lands."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.67952,
      "end": 18.776726999999998,
      "text": "The idea started"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.790644999999998,
      "end": 19.346186,
      "text": "in the city"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.360060999999998,
      "end": 20.276728,
      "text": "of Nagaoka in"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.290644999999998,
      "end": 21.693395,
      "text": "the nineteen sixties."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.9534082,
      "end": 22.647824199999995,
      "text": "It works there"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.661741199999998,
      "end": 23.439533199999996,
      "text": "because the snow"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.4534082,
      "end": 24.5784082,
      "text": "falls near freezing"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.592283199999997,
      "end": 25.286740199999997,
      "text": "so the water"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.300616199999997,
      "end": 25.870074199999998,
      "text": "doesn't turn"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.883949199999996,
      "end": 26.550615199999996,
      "text": "to ice."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.8106284,
      "end": 27.5189614,
      "text": "The catch is"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.532836399999997,
      "end": 28.310627399999998,
      "text": "it uses lots"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.324503399999998,
      "end": 29.116169399999997,
      "text": "of water and"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.130086399999996,
      "end": 29.5883774,
      "text": "can make the"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.602294399999998,
      "end": 30.366169399999997,
      "text": "ground sink."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.6261826,
      "end": 31.598389599999997,
      "text": "So newer roads"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.612307599999998,
      "end": 32.3067236,
      "text": "keep the warm"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.3206406,
      "end": 33.1955986,
      "text": "water in pipes"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.209515599999996,
      "end": 34.0428486,
      "text": "under the pavement."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.3028618,
      "end": 34.9278608,
      "text": "That's why some"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.9417368,
      "end": 35.9695278,
      "text": "streets in Japan"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.9834028,
      "end": 36.6639858,
      "text": "wash their own"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.6778618,
      "end": 37.2889868,
      "text": "snow away."
    }
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.7322211999999992,
      "narration_en": "Why is this road spraying water in a snowstorm?",
      "source_audio_sha256": "29ba90ceb76f8396755067365a8252b15857859ad053f01377abaf32bb057722"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.7322211999999992,
      "end": 6.839483399999999,
      "narration_en": "In snowy parts of Japan sprinklers are built right into the street.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3de3be6f339764691c20a7fbdd7ce2b70e6676e93daa0be954d752b007ca3a70"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.839483399999999,
      "end": 10.043953599999998,
      "narration_en": "Nozzles down the middle of the road spray out water.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ff9c3047d8e1cec2cdfbb5e6dd7fd05bc4239dc6ec0c0e130f6c8001fe776f50"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.043953599999998,
      "end": 13.887298799999998,
      "narration_en": "It's pumped from deep underground where it stays around fifty degrees.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "83bd22811f0354d879c7bad9bc31075c41a5b4604c910e252ef6a7af6697e6d4"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.887298799999998,
      "end": 17.619519999999998,
      "narration_en": "That's warmer than snow so the snow melts as soon as it lands.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "27829b70c51daa1acd8d88533d4d4c1c0bd76afb25f0ac7bfc357280309dc499"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.619519999999998,
      "end": 21.893408199999996,
      "narration_en": "The idea started in the city of Nagaoka in the nineteen sixties.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "0643cf11014662d4fac0c7727b58fb362a4f7140e1e2264ae8790731ad211f94"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.893408199999996,
      "end": 26.750628399999997,
      "narration_en": "It works there because the snow falls near freezing so the water doesn't turn to ice.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "c5780bdb9618e65561a49e2e7b4eed8fe0f9923aedf4971efe4571a3174e8a61"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.750628399999997,
      "end": 30.566182599999998,
      "narration_en": "The catch is it uses lots of water and can make the ground sink.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7cf3ab91eee2b0f6dc20f27ce36a5967e7c85e5d55db6f22dc9359f1b099432a"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.566182599999998,
      "end": 34.2428618,
      "narration_en": "So newer roads keep the warm water in pipes under the pavement.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "87e847fd0336bf8b474be156be008f12e7a2eeea40c56aa9e04d496a503eb863"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.2428618,
      "end": 37.489,
      "narration_en": "That's why some streets in Japan wash their own snow away.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "c643f0e24583627404d8539df3a57760f18ea0582c7ecb8811e34674f17f81f2"
    }
  ],
